#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/capturing_video.rst:-1
msgid "Kdenlive Documentation - Capturing Video"
msgstr "Dokumentácia Kdenlive - Zachytávanie videa"

#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/capturing_video.rst:-1
msgid ""
"KDE, Kdenlive, project bin, file, management, capturing, video, "
"documentation, user manual, video editor, open source, free, learn, easy"
msgstr ""
"KDE, Kdenlive, zásobník projektu, súbor, správa, zachytávanie, video, "
"dokumentácia, používateľská príručka, video editor, open source, zadarmo, "
"naučiť sa, jednoduché"

#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/capturing_video.rst:21
msgid ""
"This page is not maintained anymore and contains information referring to "
"features or functions from earlier versions of Kdenlive that are deprecated "
"or have been superseded by something else."
msgstr ""
"Táto stránka sa už neudržiava a obsahuje informácie odkazujúce na funkcie "
"alebo možnosti zo starších verzií Kdenlive, ktoré sú zastarané alebo boli "
"nahradené niečím iným."

#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/capturing_video.rst:25
msgid "Capturing Video"
msgstr "Zachytávanie videa"

#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/capturing_video.rst:29
msgid "Firewire"
msgstr "Firewire"

#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/capturing_video.rst:32
msgid ""
"This captures video from sources connected via a firewire (also known as -  "
"IEEE 1394 High Speed Serial Bus) card and cable. This functionality uses the "
"`dvgrab <http://linux.die.net/man/1/dvgrab>`__ program and the settings for "
"this can be customized by clicking the spanner icon or choosing  :"
"menuselection:`Settings --> Configure Kdenlive`.  See :doc:`Configure "
"Kdenlive </getting_started/configuration>`."
msgstr ""
"Toto zachytáva video zo zdrojov pripojených cez firewire (tiež známy ako "
"IEEE 1394 High Speed Serial Bus) kartu a kábel. Táto funkcia používa program "
"`dvgrab <http://linux.die.net/man/1/dvgrab>`__ a nastavenia je možné "
"prispôsobiť kliknutím na ikonu kľúča alebo výberom :menuselection:"
"`Nastavenia --> Konfigurovať Kdenlive`. Pozrite si :doc:`Konfigurácia "
"Kdenlive</getting_started/configuration>`."

#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/capturing_video.rst:35
msgid "To perform a capture:"
msgstr "Postup zachytávania:"

#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/capturing_video.rst:38
msgid "Plug in your device to the firewire card and turn it on to play mode"
msgstr ""
"Zapojte zariadenie do firewire karty a prepnite ho do režimu prehrávania"

#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/capturing_video.rst:41
msgid "Click the *Connect Button*"
msgstr "Kliknite na *Tlačidlo Pripojiť*"

#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/capturing_video.rst:46
msgid ""
"Click the Record Button – note it toggles to grey while you are recording"
msgstr ""
"Kliknite na Tlačidlo nahrávky – všimnite si, že počas nahrávania sa zmení na "
"sivé"

#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/capturing_video.rst:49
msgid ""
"Click the Record button again to stop capture. Or click the stop button."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite znova na Tlačidlo nahrávky a zastavte zachytávanie. Alebo kliknite "
"na tlačidlo zastavenia."

#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/capturing_video.rst:52
msgid "Once capturing is finished, click the disconnect button"
msgstr "Po dokončení zachytávania kliknite na tlačidlo odpojenia"

#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/capturing_video.rst:58
msgid ""
"In the *Captured Files* dialog, click the import button to have the captured "
"files automatically imported into the project bin."
msgstr ""
"V dialógu *Zachytené súbory* kliknite na tlačidlo importu, aby sa zachytené "
"súbory automaticky importovali do zásobníka projektu."

#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/capturing_video.rst:67
msgid ""
"If your device does not start playing the source device when you click the "
"record button, you may have to start playback on your device manually and "
"then click record."
msgstr ""
"Ak vaše zariadenie nespustí prehrávanie zdrojového zariadenia po kliknutí na "
"tlačidlo nahrávky, možno budete musieť spustiť prehrávanie na zariadení "
"manuálne a potom kliknúť na nahrávku."

#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/capturing_video.rst:71
msgid "FFmpeg"
msgstr "FFmpeg"

#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/capturing_video.rst:73
msgid ""
"I believe this captures video from an installed Web Cam using *Video4Linux2*."
msgstr ""
"Predpokladám, že toto zachytáva video z nainštalovanej webovej kamery "
"pomocou *Video4Linux2*."
